    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index climbed by 840 points week-on-week to the strongest level since July at 6,750. The W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate rose by $1.40/t to $10.25/t, while the round-voyage rate increased by $6,850/day to $19,350/day.",
